    tier: "Tier II: Controlling Winds & Channels",
    chakra: "Six Bodily Chakras",
    mechanic:
      "Binding the purified prāṇas and essential drops (bindus) firmly at the six primary energy centers.",
    experience:
      "Coarse respiration ceases entirely; the practitioner abides in unmoving retention for days.",
    source:
      "Sekoddeśa: 'Retention is fixing the prāṇas in the central channel at the crown, forehead, throat, heart, navel, and secret.'",
