    experience:
      "The physical aggregates transmute into the Sambhogakāya rainbow body endowed with all 112 marks of Buddhahood.",
    source:
      "Dölpopa's Mountain Dharma: 'The definitive union of supreme empty form and unchanging bliss is the state of the Primordial Buddha.'",
